# The scene is a BUILD ARTIFACT, not source: scene/build_room.py generates room.xml
# and the 59 textures it references, deterministically from a fixed seed, so every
# checkout regenerates an identical room. Committing room.xml without the textures
# would ship a scene file pointing at files that are not there.
